# Onderon, Master Kavar and the escape from Iziz (TSL, 512OND, 503OND,
# 502OND, 501OND, 403DXN): Bakkel in the beast-riders' room told she has
# Dhagon's discs and offered to sell them (she attacks), her gang fought,
# her remains searched (the encrypted holodisks, an open starport visa),
# the open visa given to Terlyn for her family by the starport gate (LSP),
# the holodisks for Dhagon and the meeting called (Talia's doubts and
# Kavar leaving the Palace, a_dhagon), Kavar in the cantina (surprised to
# see him alive, asked why the Exile was cast out: Colonel Tobin
# interrupts), Tobin's men fought (Mira on lines of fire), the escape
# fought through the Western Square, the Merchant Quarter and its turrets
# to the spaceport, Mandalore at the shuttle, and back to Dxun (OndMov06).
# Starts from Dhagon's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_dhagon data/routes/tsl/onderon_kavar.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Iziz Cantina" ("The Meeting", "Get Out of
# Onderon") (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the other open visa's buyers (Xaart, Gormo: the Rodians' visa is
# not looted and Kiph's slicing not bought), Tobin's
# deal (Vaklu's side only: tobin.dlg start 0).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - cantinarats active: k_503_enter spawns Bakkel (tag bakkel, from
#   npc_bakkel) at wp_bakkel and takes Panar away.
# - Bakkel's remains are searched by her tag, as Telos's HK-50s'
#   were; the holodisks are what Dhagon's R16 asks (c_holo_check).
# - Dhagon's "Contact the Jedi Master now." runs on into his
#   start 3 (the throne-room cut) in the same conversation; a_dhagon then
#   loads 503OND at From_502OND_Dhagon, where Kavar's talk starts
#   (tr_end_kavar). The throne-room lines are Kavar's and Talia's, 1400 m
#   off in 512OND: found because a_force_update flagged them
#   (SetForceAlwaysUpdate, probe far_speaker_always_update).
# - Kavar's talk runs on into Tobin's interruption (one conversation);
#   Mira's lines of fire answered with the harness's first reply.
# - The light way: the Queen's side never taken against (no Vaklu line,
#   no Anda), so Tobin does not come back with his deal (tobin.dlg).
# - the escape's foes (c_endgame: the turret_iziz creatures in
#   502OND, end_mark's soldiers) are fought by `fight` and the exits; the
#   civilians are left alone.
exit To_503
module 503ond
say You have something that belongs to Dhagon Ghent. # Bakkel
say I was hoping I might be able to buy any holodisks
use bakkel
talk
fight 20             # Bakkel and her gang (a_bakkel_attack)
use bakkel           # her remains: the encrypted holodisks
exit To_502          # out to the Western Square
module 512ond
exit To_502          # Terlyn by the starport gate: Bakkel's open visa
module 502ond        # for her family (a_visa_quest: LSP, 700 XP)
say I found an open starport visa in my travels.
use terlyn
talk
exit To_512
module 512ond
say I got the holodisks from Bakkel. # Dhagon (start 2)
say Contact the Jedi Master now.
use dhagon
talk
module 503ond        # the meeting (a_dhagon)
say Master Kavar? I didn't know you were still alive.
say I want to know why I was cast out of the Jedi Order. # a_endgame
talk                 # Kavar, then Colonel Tobin interrupting: one talk
fight 30             # Tobin's men in the cantina
exit To_502
module 512ond
fight 30
exit To_502
module 502ond
fight 40             # the turrets and soldiers (c_endgame)
exit To_501
module 501ond
talk                 # Mandalore: the shuttle ahead (end_mand)
say [Return to Dxun.]
use shuttle_iziz     # a_to_dxun (OndMov06)
module 403dxn
save dxun_return
